  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot, heat 2 tbsp of oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion, carrot, and celery, and cook until the vegetables are tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the beef stock cubes and beef broth, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the chopped nuka-pickle and stir to combine.",
    "If using flour, add it to the pot and stir to combine.",
    "Add the water to the pot and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, topped with sour cream and thyme if desired."
